# Written by Laravel Herd, which bundles its own nvm and pins each site's Node
# version here. It records this machine's Node (23), not the project's — CI and
# the Dockerfile both build with Node 22 — so committing it would advertise a
# version nothing is ever tested or shipped against. Herd recreates the file
# on its own; ignoring it just keeps it out of git status and out of commits.
.nvmrc
